  ],
  "result": {
    "report": "# Maester Pack Candidates: Research Report (2026-11-08)\n\n## How to read this\n\nThe facts here come from candidate research that was fact-checked against primary pages on 2026-11-08: cisecurity.org, cyber.trackr.live (a mirror of the DISA STIG library), vendor docs and GitHub repos. Web search ran out partway through, so later checks used direct page f
